# Legal Mind Development Skill Router

**Context:** Legal Mind dashboard — Vite + React 18 (JS) + Supabase (ezxihctobrqoklufawim) + Vercel (legal-mind-dashboard).

**Hard-rules first:** Read `/workspace/CLAUDE.md` before changing code. Hard-rules (realtime helper, no FooV2, anthropic wrapper, version bump, RAG cron verify_jwt:false, edge-deploy 1:1) always apply.

## Skill Routing Table

Before changing code, read the matching skill from `docs/legal-mind-skills/`:

| **Topic keywords** | **Skill to read** |
|-------------------|-------------------|
| agents, schedules, health, agent_runs, agent_schedules, cron monitoring | `agent-manager/SKILL.md` |
| table, view, RPC, RLS, migration, schema, Postgres, SQL, indexes | `database-manager/SKILL.md` |
| RAG, chunks, embeddings, kb-*, chunker, context-build, vector search | `datascience/SKILL.md` |
| auth, Vault, deploy, git, logging, security, edge functions, MCP | `agent-handbook/SKILL.md` |

**If multiple topics:** start with the primary skill, then hand off via the skill's cross-reference guidance.

**If no match:** read `agent-handbook/SKILL.md` as the default operational guide.

