## Core principles

1. **Live data, not memory:** Always query Supabase for current state; never rely on stale knowledge
2. **Hand off across skills:** When your change spans multiple domains, read the additional skill(s)
3. **No orchestrator execution:** Never run the daily agent orchestrator; only modify its code or config when explicitly requested
4. **Hard-rules enforcement:** All CLAUDE.md pre-flight checks must pass before push

